<title>JAPAN: Sapporo to form beer venture in Taiwan - paper.</title>
<headline>Sapporo to form beer venture in Taiwan - paper.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sapporo Breweries Ltd has agreed with Taiwanese food trading company Tong Hsun Hsin Trading Co to set up a joint venture to produce and sell Sapporo-brand beer in Taiwan, a Japanese newspaper said on Friday.</p>
<p>The Japanese economic daily Nihon Keizai Shimbun said sales were expected to start in 1999.</p>
<p>The total investment in the project is expected to be about 12 billion yen.</p>
<p>Sapporo officials were not immediately available to comment on the report.</p>
</text>
